      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَكْمُورٌ</span></b>  A man (S) <i>having the head</i> [or <i>glans</i>]
<i>of his penis,</i> (Msb, K,) or <i>the extremity of the
head of his penis,</i> (S,) <i>hurt,</i> or <i>wounded, by the
circumciser.</i> (S, Msb, K.)

